SymmetricSector.phaseHhat_supersolution (N : ℕ) (hN : 3 ≤ N) :
  (SymmetricSector.phaseD N).mulVec (SymmetricSector.phaseV N) ≤
    (1 - SymmetricSector.phaseQ N).mulVec (SymmetricSector.phaseHhat N)
'SymmetricSector.phaseHhat_supersolution' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
SymmetricSector.phaseC_hhat_le (N : ℕ) (hN : 3 ≤ N) :
  (SymmetricSector.phaseC N).mulVec (SymmetricSector.phaseHhat N) ≤ SymmetricSector.c N • SymmetricSector.goodReward N
